            "review_title": "Review at An Tuong Cafe",
            "review_text": "Duni1982\nZurich, Switzerland12 contributions\n0\nNice Place and very good Pizza&Pasta\nJul 2019 • Friends\nThe Place is very nice with a garden - relaxing! Food is good too, we tried asian food but as well pizza and spaghetti. The pizza is very near to the real pizza we know from europe - for asian circumstances the pizza was very good!\nThe crepe was nice too - really worth going there to eat something else than asian food! 👍🏻\nWritten July 28, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
