            "review_title": "Review at An Tuong Cafe",
            "review_text": "Bill C\nColumbus, Ohio17 contributions\n0\nGreat atmosphere and good food\nNov 2018 • Friends\nThis is a very cozy little Italian restaurant. There is an indoor and an outdoor seating area. I've been here a few times and I like everything I've had.\n\nFrom the outside, it looks different then the other building surrounding it as it has a stone wall, but it is still quite easy to miss if you aren't paying attention.\n\nThe staff is very friendly and patient, which seems to be normal in this area. They even brought us cheesecake for dessert free of charge the first time I visited.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 15, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-03",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
