            "review_title": "Review at An Tuong Cafe",
            "review_text": "Shaun_A_M\nPietermaritzburg, South Africa22 contributions\n0\nGreat atmosphere & Good food!\nOct 2018 • Couples\nExcellent little spot with tranquil outdoor garden seating area. Indoor seating also available for those rainy days! Been two days in a row! Only eaten from the breakfast menu so far, both occasions did not dissapoint. Will definitely be back to sample some of there other dishes on offer. Wide selection of western dishes available as a few vietnamese dishes also on offer.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 19, 2018",
